title: 'Rent a machine, or keep the work on this laptop? I recommend renting only if you want this laptop free: it would not make missions faster.'
pid: 07444b7d-67c8-4bee-b50b-e695c9ae0b75
body: |2-
  Type "rent" or "stay" under this.
  If you do not answer, nothing is rented, and the work stays on this laptop.
